OL,3,GNEWSABolshoi dancer's pride over
OL,4,AYorkshire return
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Barnsley ballerina who became only
OL,7,Fthe third British female to graduate
OL,8,Ffrom the elite Bolshoi Ballet Academy
OL,9,Fis bringing a show to her home town.
OL,11,FTala Lee-Turton is the creative
OL,12,Fproducer of PIA, a performance which
OL,13,Fcontrasts a woman's experiences of
OL,14,Fgrowing up among the closed collieries
OL,15,Fof Barnsley with her vivid dreams of
OL,16,Fspace travel.
OL,18,FIt will premiere at the Barbican in
OL,19,FLondon later this month, with a
OL,20,Fperformance at Barnsley Civic next
OL,21,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
