OL,3,GNEWSABolshoi dancer's pride over
OL,4,AYorkshire return
OL,5,
OL,6,FLee-Turton said: "I'm proud to be
OL,7,Fcontributing to Barnsley's cultural
OL,8,Flegacy through PIA, and am delighted
OL,9,Fthat it will be performed there as well
OL,10,Fas in London."
